      "text": "消息 pending / dedup / chat lease\nSession Facts / stage / workbench / brand state\nCollection Form / geocode cache / dashboard cache\nBull queue 内部状态\n\n特点：低延迟、TTL、原子命令 / Lua\n风险：过期或丢失后部分状态不可重建",
